schway-screen 1
screen command-palette
title Command palette
description Typing a slash opens command suggestions.
variant light-120
size 120x30
cursor 8 27 visible
== text
 ⚡ schway  /project


  scripted/scripted-model · scripted API key · configured, unverified

  Type a task · Enter sends













   › [built-in] /model Choose model or profile
    [built-in] /thinking Set reasoning level
    [built-in] /theme Choose appearance
    [built-in] /delete-session Delete a saved session and its draft
    [built-in] /session Session and workspace details
    [built-in] /new Start a session
